BT /F2 7.6 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 56.0 399.4 Td (1. Integer Money Math Everywhere) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.30 0.30 0.30 rg 201.0 399.4 Td (Never allow IEEE-754 floats in financial ledgers. Microcents guarantee exact zero-leakage accounting.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.6 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 56.0 388.6 Td (2. Pre-Action Quota Gating) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.30 0.30 0.30 rg 201.0 388.6 Td (Never meter after execution. Pre-action checks protect compute and prevent uncollectible debt.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.6 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 56.0 377.8 Td (3. Idempotency Response Caching) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.30 0.30 0.30 rg 201.0 377.8 Td (Deduplicating requires caching full response bodies so retries mirror original responses exactly.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.6 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 56.0 367.0 Td (4. Webhook Replay Deduplication) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.30 0.30 0.30 rg 201.0 367.0 Td (Always persist processed event IDs. Network retries must safely no-op without duplicating state flips.) Tj ET
BT /F2 7.6 Tf 0.20 0.20 0.20 rg 56.0 356.2 Td (5. Cryptographic Self-Reliance) Tj ET
BT /F1 7.6 Tf 0.30 0.30 0.30 rg 201.0 356.2 Td (Implementing HMAC-SHA256 directly guarantees zero external dependencies and total testability.) Tj ET
